<a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/60018618-unreasonable-hospitality">Unreasonable Hospitality: The Remarkable Power of Giving People More Than They Expect</a> by <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/5098860.Will_Guidara">Will Guidara
